DUCKDB QUERIES
--------------
[OK] get_tax_kpi_trend(n_windows)       - DATE_TRUNC 5-min windows from cleaned-tax glob
[OK] get_fraud_summary()                - fraud signals by type/severity/province
[OK] get_cleaned_data_for_ml(n_rows)    - labelled records for MLflow training
[OK] get_income_distribution(n_buckets) - histogram buckets with labels
[OK] get_top_flagged_customers(top_n)   - customers ranked by fraud signal count
[OK] get_province_fraud_heatmap()       - province-level fraud rate + avg income

All DuckDB functions return pandas DataFrames with graceful empty fallback on failure.
httpfs extension configured with:
  SET s3_endpoint='minio:9000'
  SET s3_access_key_id / s3_secret_access_key (from .env)
  SET s3_use_ssl=false
  SET s3_url_style='path'

MINIO CLIENT
------------
[OK] get_client()                 - boto3 with s3v4 signature, path-style URL
[OK] list_files(bucket, prefix)   - paginated, handles >1000 objects
[OK] list_partitions(bucket)      - returns immediate subdirectory names (Delimiter='/')
[OK] bucket_has_files(bucket)     - preflight guard used by make seed
[OK] download_file / download_to_bytes / download_prefix_to_dir
[OK] upload_file / upload_bytes
[OK] get_cleaned_file_uris()      - returns s3a:// URIs for cleaned-tax files (Flink-style)

REDIS SCHEMA DOCUMENTED
------------------------
Key families documented in redis_schema.md:
  tax:kpi:window:<ts>   HASH TTL=900s  (per-window metrics)
  tax:kpi:latest        HASH TTL=900s  (latest window summary)
  tax:agent:session:<id> LIST TTL=3600s (chat history)
  tax:fraud:alert:<id>   STRING TTL=1800s (active alerts)

NOTES
-----
- DuckDB queries require cleaned-tax bucket to be non-empty (Flink job_05 must be running)
- All DuckDB functions have empty DataFrame fallback for graceful dashboard degradation
- minio_client.py __main__ block can be run for connectivity smoke test:
    podman exec streamlit python /app/../storage/minio_client.py
